Third-party material bundled with this project
==============================================

Card faces and backs
--------------------
The 54 card images embedded in index.html (the <style id="deck"> block) are the
SVG playing cards by Adrian Kennard (RevK), dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal.

    Home:   https://www.me.uk/cards
    Source: https://codeberg.org/RevK/SVG-playing-cards

CC0 requires no attribution; this notice is here because the deck earned it. The
author does ask, without requiring it, that the link he embeds in the ace of
spades be left intact. It has been removed from this copy, which CC0 permits.

Everything else in this repository, the interface icons included, is original
work covered by the MIT licence in LICENSE.
